description = "Non-Thermal Engines, the \"heart\" of the most powerful Entities. The mechanics of NT Engines are an enigma, as they appear to violate the laws of thermodynamics - driving AVIS-based mechanisms without producing any waste energy. Taken from Entity hearts (only the Fisher's, so far). Used in advanced SAV generators and cores."
